cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "nrtqc-diff"
abstract: >-
  A static dashboard comparing the near real time QC flags that ship with
  Copernicus Marine in situ CTD profiles with the flags nrtqclib computes for
  the same observations: a Python build step that trims the nrtqclib output
  into small parquet files, analyses of the differences in Python and R, and
  a Quarto site that queries the files in the browser with DuckDB WASM.
authors:
  - family-names: "Saito"
    given-names: "Takaya"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AIQC-Hub/nrtqc-diff"
url: "https://aiqc-hub.github.io/nrtqc-diff/"
license: MIT
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24094695"
keywords:
  - oceanography
  - CTD
  - quality control
  - near real time
  - Copernicus Marine
version: "0.12.0"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
